<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets call, put warrants on SMI.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets call, put warrants on SMI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel said four two tranches each of American-style call and put warrants on the Swiss Market Index.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.FEB.97-20.FEB.98   LISTING	SWISS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4,450 CHF</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE    ISSUE     * WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A     4,600     2.85 CHF  *  PUT B     4,400	2.85 CHF</p>
<p> CALL C     4,800     2.10 CHF  *  PUT D     4,200	1.95 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
